          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwiteka aravuga ngo ‘Nuko nimunyumvana umwete, ntimugire umutwaro mucisha mu marembo y'uyu murwa ku munsi w'isabato, ahubwo mukaweza ntimugire umurimo muwukoraho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni bwo abami n'ibikomangoma bari ku ngoma ya Dawidi bazinjira muri uyu murwa, bari ku magare y'intambara no ku mafarashi bo n'ibikomangoma byabo, n'abantu b'u Buyuda n'abatuye i Yerusalemu, kandi uyu murwa uzahoraho iteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bazaturuka mu midugudu y'u Buyuda n'ahakikije i Yerusalemu hose no mu gihugu cy'Ababenyamini, no mu bibaya no mu misozi miremire n'ikusi, bazanye ibitambo byoswa n'ibindi bitambo n'amaturo y'ifu n'imibavu, bazanye n'ibyo gushima mu nzu y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nimwanga kunyumvira ngo mweze umunsi w'isabato, ahubwo mukikorera imitwaro mukayinyuza mu marembo y'i Yerusalemu kuri uwo munsi, nzakongeza umuriro mu marembo yaho uzatwika amanyumba y'i Yerusalemu, kandi ntabwo uzazimywa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
